  { question: 'What should I eat before a workout?', answer: 'A practical pre-workout meal usually includes a carbohydrate source for energy, some protein and foods you digest comfortably. The exact amount and timing depend on the person, meal size, workout type and how much time you have before training.' },
  { question: 'How long before a workout should I eat?', answer: 'A larger meal is often easier to tolerate a few hours before training, while a smaller snack may work closer to the session. Individual digestion varies, so use your own experience rather than forcing one timing rule.' },
